// CONFORMANCE-CASE
// spec: 14-control-flow
// facility: rule.control.flow-analysis (literal-operand constant fold)
// kind: negative
// expect: diag.arith-overflow (static)
//
// The flow-analysis pass constant-folds literal-operand arithmetic
// and refutes an overflow before the program runs at all -- a
// stricter, earlier rejection than the same fault reached through a
// runtime value would get.

fn main()
{
    2147483647 + 1;
}
